msgid ""
":ref:`Copter's user wiki for precision landing <copter:precision-landing-"
"and-loiter>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Copter 精准降落用户 wiki <copter:precision-landing-and-loiter>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-precision-landing.rst:12
