"landing-support-testers-needed/114072>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-precision-landing.rst:13
#: e7063aa2322f4593a621fc503285deaf
msgid ""
"`MAVLink's Landing Target documentation "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/landing_target.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"`MAVLink 降落目标文档 <https://mavlink.io/en/services/landing_target.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-precision-landing.rst:14
#: b06cbf1e107842d69fa4f74bc17acd16
msgid ":ref:`Testing Precision Landing in SITL <testing_precision_landing>`"
msgstr ":ref:`在 SITL 中测试精准降落 <testing_precision_landing>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-precision-landing.rst:16
#: 54ed3e00590145da8ec081f0d4b928b2
msgid ""
"Users should follow the :ref:`user precision landing wiki page "
"<copter:precision-landing-and-loiter>` including setting :ref:`PLND_TYPE "
"<PLND_TYPE>` = 1 (MAVLink)"
msgstr ""
"用户应遵循 :ref:`精准降落用户 wiki 页面 <copter:precision-landing-and-loiter>` 的说明，包括将 "
":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` 设置为 1（MAVLink）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-precision-landing.rst:18
#: 9264bbbfe6f549a19bb0f25a3a7d014f
msgid ""
"The external camera system should send the `LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ message to "
"the autopilot at no less than 1hz (a higher rate is better)."
msgstr ""
"外部摄像系统应以不低于 1Hz 的频率（频率越高越好）向自动驾驶仪发送 `LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-precision-landing.rst:20
#: 4fb0f2c9ec1a4ece800faa8b2f46d357
msgid ""
"If the x (e.g. forward), y (e.g. right) and z (e.g. down) distance to the "
"target is known (in body frame) then \"x\", \"y\" and \"z\" fields should be"
" populated, and \"position_valid\" should be set to \"1\"."
msgstr ""
"若已知目标在机体坐标系中的 x（如前方）、y（如右侧）和 z（如下方）距离，则应填写 「x」、「y」 和 「z」 字段，并将 "
"「position_valid」 设置为 「1」。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-precision-landing.rst:22
#: f95bdbfe99504574af2743e1e8b6cd1e
msgid ""
"If only the body-frame angle to the target is known then \"angle_x\" and "
"\"angle_y\" fields should be populated and \"position_valid\" should be set "
"to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"若只知道目标相对机体坐标系的角度，则应填写 「angle_x」 和 「angle_y」 字段，并将 「position_valid」 设置为 「0」。"
